{"script":"s_1_20_1_y","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]这就是简易路障吗？我看看效果如何……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]呀！果然很坚固，而且成本也不算太高！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]了不起！不愧是工匠，轻而易举就做到了我们做不到的事情！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]这样一来，我们的工作压力就能大大减轻了，魔物也别想轻易打扰我们的生活了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]我这就叫大家来学习……还劳驾你们简单和我们讲一下这东西的制作方法了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]当然了，你们的报酬一定是少不了的。来，这是你们应得的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]风车小镇的发展，少不了你们的帮助！真的是万分感谢！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]唔。可、可是不知道为什么……唔，我好想踢它一脚啊！[r]不、不行，这可是难得的样品——唔，我好难受啊！让我踢它一下吧！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"民兵阿茶","text":"[show]不、不行不行……我到底在干什么呢……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"{myName}","text":"[show]（不久，在大家都学会了制作方法后，村里很快装满了这种简易路障。）[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"{myName}","text":"[show]（但不知道为什么，大家走过路过都会去踢它两脚，好像它自带什么嘲讽功能一样……真是非常奇怪呢。）[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"","text":"[hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"【（将路障交给民兵。）】"}